From 89517ef7d2b440109998f9efee6c87f046261bdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:52:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libva: Restore va_log* macros needed by the retained Android
 shim

A real build (2h27m in, 128060/172944 targets done) failed compiling
va/android/va_android.cpp with 7 "use of undeclared identifier"
errors for va_loge/va_logd.

The 2.23.0 overlay removed the entire va_loge/va_logi/va_logv/va_logd
macro block from va_internal.h (an ANDROID-vs-else #ifdef wrapping
ALOGE/ALOGI/ALOGV/ALOGD or fprintf fallbacks) with no replacement --
unrelated to, but discovered alongside, upstream's separate removal of
va_android.cpp/va_android.h itself. Since va_android.cpp is being kept
as a fork-local addition (earlier decision in this series, because
mediasdk_c2 and media-driver's cmrtlib depend on vaGetDisplay()), its
va_loge/va_logd calls need this macro block back too.

Restored verbatim from the pre-upgrade va_internal.h. No other build
errors were reported for va_android.cpp in the same compiler
invocation, so this is the only missing piece for this file.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 va/va_internal.h | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/va/va_internal.h b/va/va_internal.h
index 784e01c..eb0c92d 100644
--- a/va/va_internal.h
+++ b/va/va_internal.h
@@ -25,6 +25,23 @@
 #ifndef VA_INTERNAL_H
 #define VA_INTERNAL_H
 
+#ifdef ANDROID
+#include <log/log.h>
+
+#define va_loge(format, ...) ALOGE(format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+#define va_logi(format, ...) ALOGI(format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+#define va_logv(format, ...) ALOGV(format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+#define va_logd(format, ...) ALOGD(format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+
+#else
+
+#define va_loge(format, ...) fprintf(stderr, format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+#define va_logi(format, ...) fprintf(stdout, format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+#define va_logv(format, ...) fprintf(stdout, format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+#define va_logd(format, ...) fprintf(stdout, format, ##__VA_ARGS__)
+
+#endif
+
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 extern "C" {
 #endif
-- 
2.34.1

